WEBVTT

00:10:58.476 --> 00:11:00.596
to pay for childcare benefits.

00:11:00.916 --> 00:11:05.396
The reality is, the childcare
business model is broken.

00:11:05.836 --> 00:11:07.516
You know, we don’t pay childcare --

00:11:07.516 --> 00:11:10.476
we pay zookeepers more
than we pay childcare workers.

00:11:10.476 --> 00:11:11.996
And so they don't make enough.

00:11:11.996 --> 00:11:14.516
Now, that's why they're not
coming back to work,

00:11:14.556 --> 00:11:16.676
and there's so many open
childcare positions

00:11:16.676 --> 00:11:20.596
because the pay is not just,

00:11:20.636 --> 00:11:23.916
and so we have to figure out --

00:11:23.916 --> 00:11:25.836
So the government was supposed to,

00:11:25.876 --> 00:11:29.676
by creating a ceiling on what you
would pay in childcare expenses,

00:11:29.676 --> 00:11:32.636
was supposed to be able
to help close that gap